flowchart TD
    Start([Housekeeping finds item]) --> LogItem[Record description, location, and storage reference]
    LogItem --> SecureStorage[Place in secure storage]
    SecureStorage --> CheckOwnership{Can potential owner be identified?}

    CheckOwnership -- Yes --> ContactGuest[Contact potential owner via phone or email]
    ContactGuest --> GuestResponse{Guest responds?}

    GuestResponse -- No --> MonitorRetention[Wait in secure storage]
    GuestResponse -- Yes --> CompareDetails{Verify item details with guest}

    CheckOwnership -- No --> UnidentifiedWait[Hold in secure storage]
    UnidentifiedWait --> WaitInquiry{Claimant comes forward?}

    WaitInquiry -- No --> MonitorRetention
    WaitInquiry -- Yes --> CompareDetails

    CompareDetails -- Mismatch --> RejectClaim[Log failed verification]
    RejectClaim --> MonitorRetention

    CompareDetails -- Match --> FulfillmentMethod{Collection or shipping?}

    FulfillmentMethod -- Collection --> Pickup[Guest collects at reception with ID]
    FulfillmentMethod -- Shipping --> ArrangeShip[Arrange payment and dispatch courier]

    Pickup --> DocumentHandover[Document handover and close case]
    ArrangeShip --> DocumentHandover
    DocumentHandover --> EndClaimed([Item successfully returned])

    MonitorRetention --> CheckDeadline{Retention deadline reached?}
    CheckDeadline -- No --> MonitorRetention
    CheckDeadline -- Yes --> FinalDisposition[Dispose, donate, or auction according to policy]
    FinalDisposition --> EndArchived([Case closed and archived])
